\'b5 Vang; th\'b5nh l\'cbp qu\'cbn C\'c8m L\'d6, th\'b5nh ph\'e8 \'a7\'b5 N\'bdng nh\'ad sau:
\par 1. \'a7i\'d2u ch\'d8nh 19,20 ha di\'d6n t\'ddch t\'f9 nhi\'aan v\'b5 2.815 nh\'a9n kh\'c8u c\'f1a ph\'ad\'eang An Kh\'aa thu\'e9c qu\'cbn Thanh Kh\'aa v\'d2 ph\'ad\'eang Thanh L\'e9c \'a7\'b8n qu\'b6n l\'fd.
\par 2. \'a7i\'d2u ch\'d8nh 32 ha di\'d6n t\'ddch t\'f9 nhi\'aan v\'b5 5.742 nh\'a9n kh\'c8u c\'f1a ph\'ad\'eang Thanh L\'e9c \'a7\'b8n thu\'e9c qu\'cbn Thanh Kh\'aa v\'d2 ph\'ad\'eang An Kh\'aa qu\'b6n l\'fd.
\par }{\expnd0\expndtw-4 3. Th\'b5nh l\'cbp ph\'ad\'eang Ho\'b5 Kh\'aa thu\'e9c qu\'cbn Thanh Kh\'aa tr\'aan c\'ac s\'eb 161,80 ha}{ di\'d6n t\'ddch t\'f9 nhi\'aan v\'b5 14.454 nh\'a9n kh\'c8u c\'f1a ph\'ad\'eang An Kh\'aa.
\par Ph\'ad\'eang Ho\'b5 Kh\'aa c\'e3 161,80 ha di\'d6n t\'ddch t\'f9 nhi\'aan v\'b5 14.454 nh\'a9n kh\'c8u.
\par \'a7\'dea gi\'edi h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh ph\'ad\'eang Ho\'b5 Kh\'aa: \'a7\'abng gi\'b8p qu\'cbn H\'b6i Ch\'a9u; T\'a9y gi\'b8p ph\'ad\'eang An Kh\'aa; Nam gi\'b8p ph\'ad\'eang An Kh\'aa v\'b5 qu\'cbn H\'b6i Ch\'a9u; B\'bec gi\'b8p c\'b8c ph\'ad\'eang Thanh Kh
\'aa \'a7\'abng, Ch\'ddnh Gi\'b8n.
\par Sau khi \'aei\'d2u ch\'d8nh \'ae\'dea gi\'edi h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh, th\'b5nh l\'cbp ph\'ad\'eang Ho\'b5 Kh\'aa, ph\'ad\'eang An Kh\'aa c\'dfn l\'b9i 213 ha di\'d6n t\'ddch t\'f9 nhi\'aan v\'b5 19.415 nh\'a9n kh\'c8u.
\par }\pard \qj \fi562\li0\ri0\sb320\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {4. Chia ph\'ad\'eang Thanh L\'e9c \'a7\'b8n thu\'e9c qu\'cbn Thanh Kh\'aa th\'b5nh ph\'ad\'eang }{\f28 t}{hanh Kh\'aa \'a7\'abng v\'b5 ph\'ad\'eang Thanh Kh\'aa
